<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-RESULTS IN WOMENS WTA TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS IN WOMENS WTA TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$450,000 Womens WTA Tennis Tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) beat 5-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>7-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Adriana Gersi (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Maria Sanchez-Lorenzo (Spain) beat 8-Sandrine Testud (France)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Barbara Schett (Austria) beat Aleksandra Olsza (Poland) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Olga Lugina (Ukraine) beat Flora Perfetti 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Magui Serna (Spain) beat Catalina Cristea (Romania) 4-6 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>2-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Barbara Rittner (Germany) 7-5</p>
<p>6-0</p>
</text>
